## Caption (Generated)

TargetCo organizational chart showing reporting structure as of April 2026. The company has a typical SaaS structure with the CEO (Diana Walsh) overseeing five VP-level direct reports: CTO (Marcus Chen), VP Product (Rachel Stone), VP Sales (Ben Carter), VP Customer Success (Maya Singh), and CFO (Kevin Marsh). The CTO leads the largest team (28 engineers across platform, product, and data tracks). Key observation: CTO Marcus Chen owns all engineering architecture decisions and has two key lieutenants — VP Engineering Priya Nair and Staff Engineer Alex Kim. Controller role is vacant, which may require prompt filling post-close.

